                                "sense_id": "053e82bd-7f8f-3a1e-9458-d26228d319c9",
                                "text": "Nevertheless, the desire for \"long ears, houndlike head, and much throatiness\" was going on, though one of our first and most successful breeders protested [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c58d037f-d899-426b-9483-6818491e8450",
                                "sense_id": "053e82bd-7f8f-3a1e-9458-d26228d319c9",
                                "text": "And in the British Isles, there were the shepherd-type dogs already mentioned, an ancestral houndlike dog and a small house dog that could have later given rise to the terriers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f24737ac-c495-40fe-8e97-8a2102a4d303",
                                "sense_id": "053e82bd-7f8f-3a1e-9458-d26228d319c9",
                                "text": "Houndlike ears: See Drop ear. Houndlike lips: Well-developed, deep, pendulous flews."
                            }
